s to objections raised by stakeholders, providing well-structured and legally sound arguments. By streamlining these time-intensive tasks, Document Drafting Agents enable insolvency professionals to focus on strategic decision-making and case management.";}i:2;i:4755;}i:123;a:3:{i:0;s:7:"p_close";i:1;a:0:{}i:2;i:4755;}i:124;a:3:{i:0;s:12:"document_end";i:1;a:0:{}i:2;i:4755;}}